    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG John O'Brien are delighted to welcome to the market '104 Wylies Hill, Ballybay'  This 2 bedroom end of terrace dwelling is ideally located in a highly sought-after development that offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and community living. Situated within close proximity to essential amenities, including schools, shops, parks, creche and public transport. \r\n\r\nInside the residence is spacious with bright rooms, perfect for family life or entertaining guests.  The well proportioned accommodation comprises of an entrance hall, kitchen/dining room, utility, W/C, 2 bedrooms and family bathroom. \r\n   \r\nThe property is approached by a concrete driveway and to the the rear of the property you will find a large enclosed garden.  The property is cleverly designed with modern day living in mind and this home is sure to impress, offering all the modern conveniences and comforts you would expect at this level.  This property is perfect for first time buyers or investors alike. \r\n\r\n** Viewing Highly recommended.**"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room: 4.07m x 3.24m \r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 4.28m x 3.39m\r\n\r\nUtility Room: 1.88m x 1.74m \r\nW/C: 1.78m x 1.38m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.27m x 3.14m\r\nBedroom 2: 3.34m x 2.18m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.05m x 1.97m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sought after location \r\nFreshly painted internally and externally\r\nSpacious enclosed rear garden\r\nDouble glazed windows & doors \r\nWooden & Tiled Flooring throughout \r\nOil fired central heating\r\nWithin walking distance to the centre of the town and Ballybay Town Park"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C - 119717429"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From the town of Ballybay take the Castleblayney Road (R183) for 1km and the development is located on the left hand side. (DNG John O'Brien For Sale Sign Board & Pointer)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By prior appointment with sole selling agent DNG John O'Brien - telephone: 0429749933 or email: miriam@obriendng.com"
      }
